WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.860
Transport has festival restrictions even when a

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.040
brought item can be used.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.860
Plan logistics beforehand.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:09.140
Commitment devices should prevent rushed shortcuts, not

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.360
authorize prohibited work.
